#. "text": "Teleports up to 8 m away from the nearest melee enemy."},
#: scripts/units/champion_abilities.gd:145
msgid "Teleports up to 8 m away from the nearest melee enemy."
msgstr "Se téléporte jusqu'à 8 m loin de l'ennemi de mêlée le plus proche."

#. "text": "A star falls on a spot within 12 m after 1 s: 45 damage to every enemy within 3.5 m."},
